OL,3,GNEWSAMan who defrauded firm ordered to
OL,4,Apay back 44k
OL,5,
OL,6,FA packaging manager who defrauded the
OL,7,Fcompany he worked for out of more than
OL,8,F#100,000 has been ordered to pay back
OL,9,F#44,000.
OL,11,FBrian Sinclair, 54, used his position
OL,12,Fat Nobel Foods in North Scarle,
OL,13,FLincolnshire, to divert stock and place
OL,14,Ffalse orders with manufacturers to
OL,15,Fsteal from the company, police said.
OL,17,FSinclair, of Wild Street, Shaw, in
OL,18,FOldham, previously admitted one count
OL,19,Fof theft, four counts of fraud by false
OL,20,Frepresentation and two counts of fraud
OL,21,Fby abuse of position.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
